      <div class="gia-beneficios">
        <p class="gia-chip gia-reveal" style="transition-delay:.26s;animation-delay:0s"><span class="gia-punto" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 13l5 5L19 7" stroke="#fff8ea" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span>Descuentos exclusivos</span></p>
        <p class="gia-chip gia-reveal" style="transition-delay:.33s;animation-delay:.7s"><span class="gia-punto" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 13l5 5L19 7" stroke="#fff8ea" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span>Elecciones de la marca</span></p>
        <p class="gia-chip gia-reveal" style="transition-delay:.4s;animation-delay:1.4s"><span class="gia-punto" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 13l5 5L19 7" stroke="#fff8ea" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span>Contenido exclusivo</span></p>
        <p class="gia-chip gia-reveal" style="transition-delay:.47s;animation-delay:2.1s"><span class="gia-punto" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 13l5 5L19 7" stroke="#fff8ea" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span>Acceso anticipado a futuros eventos</span></p>
        <p class="gia-chip gia-reveal" style="transition-delay:.54s;animation-delay:2.8s"><span class="gia-punto" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 13l5 5L19 7" stroke="#fff8ea" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span>Y más cosas que vamos a ir construyendo juntos</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gia-wrap gia-wrap--sm gia-fundador__condicion">
      <h3 class="gia-reveal">Pero hay una condición.</h3>
      <p class="gia-reveal" style="transition-delay:.08s">Los Tickets de Fundador<br class="gia-corte-movil"> solo existen durante<br class="gia-corte-movil"> las <strong style="color:var(--gia-paper);font-weight:600">primeras 24 horas</strong>.</p>
      <p class="gia-fundador__despues gia-reveal" style="transition-delay:.14s">Después</p>
      <p class="gia-fundador__nunca gia-reveal" style="transition-delay:.2s">No va a haber forma<br class="gia-corte-movil"> de conseguir uno.</p>

      <div class="gia-valor gia-reveal" style="transition-delay:.28s">
        <p class="gia-valor__label">Valor del Ticket de Fundador</p>
        <p class="gia-valor__cifra">
          <span class="gia-valor__tachado">${{ gia_ticket_valor }}</span>
          <span class="gia-valor__flecha" aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span>
          <span class="gia-valor__gratis">Gratis</span>
        </p>
        <p class="gia-valor__nota">Se entrega junto a tu pedido, sin costo.</p>
        <p class="gia-valor__cierre">Mañana no existe.</p>
